(4335444, 624298, 58247, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better if it had a strong frontal light source instead of a strong back lighting.</td>', 'I think this would be better if it had a strong frontal light source instead of a strong back lighting.', '2007-12-26 06:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
