(4335477, 625161, 60173, '<td valign="top">I have to say at first glance I really liked this photo. However, because I liked it so much, I sat and stared at it... then I got picky...<br/> <br/>The texture is beautiful and colorful. I think you''re limiting your fan club with the baby blue border. Maybe over-sharpened as a whole? From a distance your focal point looks crisp and sharp, but when you get closer, the detail seems pixelated. You might be a touch overexposed just going by the glare off the F, but it doesn''t bother me too much. <br/> <br/>I still think it''s a beautiful photo, though! You should do well.</td>', 'I have to say at first glance I really liked this photo. However, because I liked it so much, I sat and stared at it... then I got picky... The texture is beautiful and colorful. I think you''re limiting your fan club with the baby blue border. Maybe over-sharpened as a whole? From a distance your focal point looks crisp and sharp, but when you get closer, the detail seems pixelated. You might be a touch overexposed just going by the glare off the F, but it doesn''t bother me too much.  I still think it''s a beautiful photo, though! You should do well.', '2007-12-26 06:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
