(4337930, 625469, 5364, '<td valign="top">good image, I just don''t like the crop through the door handle - it leads my eyes out of the picture.</td>', 'good image, I just don''t like the crop through the door handle - it leads my eyes out of the picture.', '2007-12-27 05:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4337933, 624843, 5364, '<td valign="top">The problem with fog is that it gives you very even lighting which means the rust doesn''t show up as a texture - it just looks like discoloured paint. I also think you could have positioned yourself to put the tower a little further to the left, rather than crowding into the middle.</td>', 'The problem with fog is that it gives you very even lighting which means the rust doesn''t show up as a texture - it just looks like discoloured paint. I also think you could have positioned yourself to put the tower a little further to the left, rather than crowding into the middle.', '2007-12-27 05:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
