(4339960, 624211, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really nice busted up old bricks. i like the vein of blue paint going through it.</td>', 'Really nice busted up old bricks. i like the vein of blue paint going through it.', '2007-12-27 23:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339966, 625691, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the appearance of the door. The comp is not working for me though. I think with a different angle and lighting on it, It would be really great.</td>', 'I really like the appearance of the door. The comp is not working for me though. I think with a different angle and lighting on it, It would be really great.', '2007-12-27 23:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339969, 625641, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lots of detail and clarity in this. Simple and bold. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Lots of detail and clarity in this. Simple and bold. I like it a lot.', '2007-12-27 23:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339974, 624137, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice kitty.... Good colors and detail of the fur.</td>', 'Nice kitty.... Good colors and detail of the fur.', '2007-12-27 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339976, 624144, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great comp, color and details.</td>', 'Great comp, color and details.', '2007-12-27 23:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339979, 624430, 83313, '<td valign="top">Expecting a brainy comment from me?</td>', 'Expecting a brainy comment from me?', '2007-12-27 23:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339988, 624941, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture showing, but I find the overall shot to not have much interest beyond that.</td>', 'Wonderful texture showing, but I find the overall shot to not have much interest beyond that.', '2007-12-27 23:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339994, 625672, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a little grainy, but for this image it works and gives it a nice film effect.</td>', 'Seems a little grainy, but for this image it works and gives it a nice film effect.', '2007-12-27 23:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339997, 624465, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one just grabbed my eyes and ripped them out of their sockets! Nice.</td>', 'This one just grabbed my eyes and ripped them out of their sockets! Nice.', '2007-12-27 23:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4339999, 624555, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking. A touch more on the sharpening may have given it some addtional "Oomph".</td>', 'Cool looking. A touch more on the sharpening may have given it some addtional "Oomph".', '2007-12-27 23:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340004, 625696, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the feathers, but the image as a whole is not wowing me. I think it is the details on the other parts of the bird that don''t seem sharp enough to me.</td>', 'I like the texture of the feathers, but the image as a whole is not wowing me. I think it is the details on the other parts of the bird that don''t seem sharp enough to me.', '2007-12-27 23:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340012, 624971, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, you get a 7 for... well, you''ve already said it. some noise showing on the blue background, but it does not distract from the image, and probably even keeps it from being too much of one thing.</td>', 'Ok, you get a 7 for... well, you''ve already said it. some noise showing on the blue background, but it does not distract from the image, and probably even keeps it from being too much of one thing.', '2007-12-27 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340013, 625560, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great contrast!! Very crisp and sharp.</td>', 'Great contrast!! Very crisp and sharp.', '2007-12-27 23:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340017, 625469, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great color and textures.</td>', 'Great color and textures.', '2007-12-27 23:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340021, 625555, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and bold. Perhaps getting the light at more of an angle at a different hour would have shown the details even more.</td>', 'Simple and bold. Perhaps getting the light at more of an angle at a different hour would have shown the details even more.', '2007-12-27 23:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340023, 624507, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great POV and DOF.</td>', 'Great POV and DOF.', '2007-12-27 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340031, 625589, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great textures.</td>', 'Great textures.', '2007-12-27 23:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340033, 625557, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great macro, you can almost feel the texture.</td>', 'Great macro, you can almost feel the texture.', '2007-12-27 23:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340037, 625798, 83313, '<td valign="top">I want to see the follow up shot, where the texture of her tongue is stuck to the texture of the ice. It''s very different from most of the other entries, including mine. (Yeah, I followed the crowd...)</td>', 'I want to see the follow up shot, where the texture of her tongue is stuck to the texture of the ice. It''s very different from most of the other entries, including mine. (Yeah, I followed the crowd...)', '2007-12-27 23:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340040, 624639, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the skin, the composition is really interesting.</td>', 'Great texture in the skin, the composition is really interesting.', '2007-12-27 23:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340042, 625544, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great job! The lighting really brings out the texture. Nice POV.</td>', 'Great job! The lighting really brings out the texture. Nice POV.', '2007-12-27 23:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340046, 624645, 83313, '<td valign="top">What is it? Looks like a partial view of a bird. It''s very dark and blurry. a negative image maybe? I can sort of identify eyes and a beak. I think.</td>', 'What is it? Looks like a partial view of a bird. It''s very dark and blurry. a negative image maybe? I can sort of identify eyes and a beak. I think.', '2007-12-27 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340049, 625560, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of those shots where I am amazed at how much detail you were able to fit into 640 pixels.</td>', 'One of those shots where I am amazed at how much detail you were able to fit into 640 pixels.', '2007-12-27 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340053, 624482, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. I can see this being used in a cookbook.</td>', 'Nice. I can see this being used in a cookbook.', '2007-12-27 23:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340057, 625796, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen quite a few frosted plants in the last few days. The recent weather presented some marvelous photo opportunities. I like this a lot. I do wonder how it looks in color, though.</td>', 'I''ve seen quite a few frosted plants in the last few days. The recent weather presented some marvelous photo opportunities. I like this a lot. I do wonder how it looks in color, though.', '2007-12-27 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340059, 624992, 58034, '<td valign="top">Unique...</td>', 'Unique...', '2007-12-27 23:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340065, 624725, 83313, '<td valign="top">If the subject is the fence, it is fighting the clouds for my attention. Perhaps a landscape crop with less of the clouds would have worked better in that regard.</td>', 'If the subject is the fence, it is fighting the clouds for my attention. Perhaps a landscape crop with less of the clouds would have worked better in that regard.', '2007-12-27 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340127, 625468, 43088, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The title helps us on what it is.  I like that the sky adds a bit of its own texture. Nice.</td>', 'Interesting. The title helps us on what it is.  I like that the sky adds a bit of its own texture. Nice.', '2007-12-28 00:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340135, 625836, 43088, '<td valign="top">Is this negative or just highly contrasty? Definately shows nice sharp textures.</td>', 'Is this negative or just highly contrasty? Definately shows nice sharp textures.', '2007-12-28 00:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340136, 624870, 43088, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene! 8</td>', 'Wonderful scene! 8', '2007-12-28 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340137, 625595, 43088, '<td valign="top">Softness is a texture too. I like the sensual curve to it.</td>', 'Softness is a texture too. I like the sensual curve to it.', '2007-12-28 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340142, 625811, 43088, '<td valign="top">Needs olive oil. And some tomatos.</td>', 'Needs olive oil. And some tomatos.', '2007-12-28 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340145, 625658, 43088, '<td valign="top">The large out of focus plant in the lower right is very distracting.</td>', 'The large out of focus plant in the lower right is very distracting.', '2007-12-28 00:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340147, 624722, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of background too.</td>', 'Nice choice of background too.', '2007-12-28 00:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340151, 625550, 43088, '<td valign="top">The water drop adds another element, but I am not sure it helps. Is it the size of it or the placement? The rest is great.</td>', 'The water drop adds another element, but I am not sure it helps. Is it the size of it or the placement? The rest is great.', '2007-12-28 00:26:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4340152, 625601, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture.</td>', 'Nice color and texture.', '2007-12-28 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340155, 625494, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice brokeh on the background. Curious how it would look cropped a bit more- make it abit more abstract? Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice brokeh on the background. Curious how it would look cropped a bit more- make it abit more abstract? Just a thought.', '2007-12-28 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340158, 624902, 43088, '<td valign="top">Hmm. It would be nice if the texture was easier to see. Definately an abstraction. I am not sure what to make of it.</td>', 'Hmm. It would be nice if the texture was easier to see. Definately an abstraction. I am not sure what to make of it.', '2007-12-28 00:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340159, 625565, 43088, '<td valign="top">This works nicely.</td>', 'This works nicely.', '2007-12-28 00:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340161, 625533, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice forus on the eye. For this challenge, I would have liked to have seen a bit more feather detail.</td>', 'Nice forus on the eye. For this challenge, I would have liked to have seen a bit more feather detail.', '2007-12-28 00:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340164, 625469, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like old things like this. Lots of history in it. Wonder if anybody still has the key for it?</td>', 'Nice. I like old things like this. Lots of history in it. Wonder if anybody still has the key for it?', '2007-12-28 00:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340166, 625640, 43088, '<td valign="top">MMmm. You just got my sugar coma started up again. I thought I had it licked. This is very lickable too. Nice sharp edges fading into silky smootheness. You were probably sick of these by the end of the shoot!</td>', 'MMmm. You just got my sugar coma started up again. I thought I had it licked. This is very lickable too. Nice sharp edges fading into silky smootheness. You were probably sick of these by the end of the shoot!', '2007-12-28 00:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340167, 624137, 43088, '<td valign="top">Dramatic shot. Would look good big on a wall!</td>', 'Dramatic shot. Would look good big on a wall!', '2007-12-28 00:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340171, 625161, 43088, '<td valign="top">An oldie but goodie. Might have been interesting to run the name on a diagonal. Maybe not. Just a thought.</td>', 'An oldie but goodie. Might have been interesting to run the name on a diagonal. Maybe not. Just a thought.', '2007-12-28 00:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340172, 625267, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your image lacks focus...</td>', 'Your image lacks focus...', '2007-12-28 00:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340173, 624137, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is great.</td>', 'This is great.', '2007-12-28 00:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340174, 625463, 43088, '<td valign="top">Rust? Looks like a dry lakebed or something. I love the few twings on it and the one point of red color. There seems to be a flow among the flakes too.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Rust? Looks like a dry lakebed or something. I love the few twings on it and the one point of red color. There seems to be a flow among the flakes too.  Nicely done!', '2007-12-28 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340178, 623980, 43088, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much of the Cypress in the upper left. I would try to simplify it a bit and maybe crop in some more. The exposure is spot on.</td>', 'I think there is too much of the Cypress in the upper left. I would try to simplify it a bit and maybe crop in some more. The exposure is spot on.', '2007-12-28 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340180, 625817, 43088, '<td valign="top">Wow. This jumps at you.</td>', 'Wow. This jumps at you.', '2007-12-28 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340182, 625617, 43088, '<td valign="top">Can I have a bite too?  Cute image.</td>', 'Can I have a bite too?  Cute image.', '2007-12-28 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340184, 625205, 43088, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones you have in this one.</td>', 'I really like the tones you have in this one.', '2007-12-28 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340186, 624555, 43088, '<td valign="top">I like all the curves in it.</td>', 'I like all the curves in it.', '2007-12-28 00:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340189, 624321, 43088, '<td valign="top">"You are NOT taking my picture are you?" 7</td>', '"You are NOT taking my picture are you?" 7', '2007-12-28 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340190, 624340, 43088, '<td valign="top">I tried one of these shots a while ago but yours is lots better than mine was. Nice exposure and color.</td>', 'I tried one of these shots a while ago but yours is lots better than mine was. Nice exposure and color.', '2007-12-28 00:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340195, 625577, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice texture. The overall image just doesn''t capture my interest though. Technically fine on the focus and exposure.</td>', 'Nice texture. The overall image just doesn''t capture my interest though. Technically fine on the focus and exposure.', '2007-12-28 00:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340199, 624547, 43088, '<td valign="top">The point of focus seems to be down on his neck while it would be much better if you could have it more on the eye. You did get nice and close for the shot.</td>', 'The point of focus seems to be down on his neck while it would be much better if you could have it more on the eye. You did get nice and close for the shot.', '2007-12-28 00:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340204, 624916, 43088, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I like it better on its side (turn clockwise 90 degrees). Could see it hanging in a bar or something. Nice texture and lighting.</td>', 'For some reason, I like it better on its side (turn clockwise 90 degrees). Could see it hanging in a bar or something. Nice texture and lighting.', '2007-12-28 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340206, 625665, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! Fantastic job! I don''t know what else to say!</td>', 'This is gorgeous! Fantastic job! I don''t know what else to say!', '2007-12-28 00:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340209, 625258, 43088, '<td valign="top">That toe looks almost like a thumb.</td>', 'That toe looks almost like a thumb.', '2007-12-28 00:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340214, 625827, 43088, '<td valign="top">Something is throwing it off for me. Maybe the difractions on the left are too much of a distraction? Have you tried it upside down?</td>', 'Something is throwing it off for me. Maybe the difractions on the left are too much of a distraction? Have you tried it upside down?', '2007-12-28 00:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340216, 625591, 43088, '<td valign="top">I find the shadow on the right to be too strong. Maybe too much contrast? I know you were trying to emphasize the texture of the basket.</td>', 'I find the shadow on the right to be too strong. Maybe too much contrast? I know you were trying to emphasize the texture of the basket.', '2007-12-28 00:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340220, 625363, 43088, '<td valign="top">Or omlette to be. Nice comparing the texture of the eggs with the carton.</td>', 'Or omlette to be. Nice comparing the texture of the eggs with the carton.', '2007-12-28 00:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340223, 625526, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting. I like the limited focus.</td>', 'This is very interesting. I like the limited focus.', '2007-12-28 00:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340226, 625247, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is pretty interesting. I am glad you included enough of the pier to show the source of the shadows.</td>', 'This is pretty interesting. I am glad you included enough of the pier to show the source of the shadows.', '2007-12-28 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340230, 624514, 43088, '<td valign="top">Looks like it really tore through there- leaves and feathers strewn in its path!</td>', 'Looks like it really tore through there- leaves and feathers strewn in its path!', '2007-12-28 00:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340232, 625643, 43088, '<td valign="top">Happy birthday! It is a lovely portrait!</td>', 'Happy birthday! It is a lovely portrait!', '2007-12-28 00:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340234, 625589, 43088, '<td valign="top">That looks like a huge ant!</td>', 'That looks like a huge ant!', '2007-12-28 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340239, 625367, 43088, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the trunk on the left and a branch from the tree on the right frame the one in the background.</td>', 'Interesting how the trunk on the left and a branch from the tree on the right frame the one in the background.', '2007-12-28 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340240, 624645, 43088, '<td valign="top">Looks underexposed and maybe out of focus to me. The composition is nice.</td>', 'Looks underexposed and maybe out of focus to me. The composition is nice.', '2007-12-28 00:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340243, 625834, 43088, '<td valign="top">Went Low key with it. I am tempted to want a bit more light tone in it, but I do like the effect you have here.</td>', 'Went Low key with it. I am tempted to want a bit more light tone in it, but I do like the effect you have here.', '2007-12-28 01:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340244, 625267, 43088, '<td valign="top">Sorry, too much blur to the fur.</td>', 'Sorry, too much blur to the fur.', '2007-12-28 01:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340250, 624558, 43088, '<td valign="top">I do see the lady- except she looks like she might have a beard to go with the long hair. Kind of like a dancing Babylonian king.</td>', 'I do see the lady- except she looks like she might have a beard to go with the long hair. Kind of like a dancing Babylonian king.', '2007-12-28 01:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340254, 625008, 43088, '<td valign="top">This would be even better if it had more sharpness of focus. I want more of the wonderful detail it has.</td>', 'This would be even better if it had more sharpness of focus. I want more of the wonderful detail it has.', '2007-12-28 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340257, 625353, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of the sun to highlight the details. It does lean towards the viewer and the right a bit though.</td>', 'Nice angle of the sun to highlight the details. It does lean towards the viewer and the right a bit though.', '2007-12-28 01:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340260, 624166, 43088, '<td valign="top">And my favorite kind of filtered light from the sun poking through the clouds.</td>', 'And my favorite kind of filtered light from the sun poking through the clouds.', '2007-12-28 01:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340261, 625139, 43088, '<td valign="top">Great tones and textures on this.</td>', 'Great tones and textures on this.', '2007-12-28 01:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340262, 624304, 43088, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure. Looks like the light may have been difficult, but you nailed it.</td>', 'Excellent exposure. Looks like the light may have been difficult, but you nailed it.', '2007-12-28 01:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340264, 625446, 43088, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. The light is fantastic with the colors in the sky and the weathered paint on the house.</td>', 'Interesting angle. The light is fantastic with the colors in the sky and the weathered paint on the house.', '2007-12-28 01:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340268, 625748, 43088, '<td valign="top">Bigger is definately better on this shot. There is an incredible amount of detail you have succeded in capturing.</td>', 'Bigger is definately better on this shot. There is an incredible amount of detail you have succeded in capturing.', '2007-12-28 01:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340270, 625812, 43088, '<td valign="top">Maybe they were moving (or you were shivering in the cold!) but the stalks seem a bit blury.</td>', 'Maybe they were moving (or you were shivering in the cold!) but the stalks seem a bit blury.', '2007-12-28 01:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340273, 624644, 43088, '<td valign="top">Simple subject, but a brilliant capture. 8. No, a 9.</td>', 'Simple subject, but a brilliant capture. 8. No, a 9.', '2007-12-28 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340278, 625505, 43088, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Sharp detail where we want it and the background gives us context without being distracting. Great control of your focus.</td>', 'Wonderful. Sharp detail where we want it and the background gives us context without being distracting. Great control of your focus.', '2007-12-28 01:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340283, 625691, 43088, '<td valign="top">There are some great colors and textures going on here. I would like to see some more of them. Curious why the door was cut off at the bottom.</td>', 'There are some great colors and textures going on here. I would like to see some more of them. Curious why the door was cut off at the bottom.', '2007-12-28 01:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340291, 625787, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a different direction. The texture seems to be more from processing afterwards? Nothing wrong with that.</td>', 'Nice to see a different direction. The texture seems to be more from processing afterwards? Nothing wrong with that.', '2007-12-28 01:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340294, 624651, 43088, '<td valign="top">(yeah, insert Nemo comments here). Nice colors and composition.</td>', '(yeah, insert Nemo comments here). Nice colors and composition.', '2007-12-28 01:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340297, 625229, 43088, '<td valign="top">I like the use of narrow focus on this one.</td>', 'I like the use of narrow focus on this one.', '2007-12-28 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340299, 625162, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice take on an object most have seen often, but never like this. The lighting is fantastic!</td>', 'Nice take on an object most have seen often, but never like this. The lighting is fantastic!', '2007-12-28 01:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340301, 625746, 43088, '<td valign="top">What did you do on this? They look like tiny atoms emitting radiation! Excellent!</td>', 'What did you do on this? They look like tiny atoms emitting radiation! Excellent!', '2007-12-28 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340303, 625697, 43088, '<td valign="top">Great low key portrait!</td>', 'Great low key portrait!', '2007-12-28 01:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340306, 625341, 43088, '<td valign="top">Focus is definately off. Try some different lighting that may show off some of the details of the pineapple better.</td>', 'Focus is definately off. Try some different lighting that may show off some of the details of the pineapple better.', '2007-12-28 01:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340307, 625534, 43088, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Back lit? The details are great.</td>', 'I love this shot. Back lit? The details are great.', '2007-12-28 01:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340311, 625501, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice textures here. I might suggest posting a larger image (you are allowed up to 64 pixels on the longest side). It makes the picture easier to see for most voters.</td>', 'Nice textures here. I might suggest posting a larger image (you are allowed up to 64 pixels on the longest side). It makes the picture easier to see for most voters.', '2007-12-28 01:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340312, 625689, 43088, '<td valign="top">Looks windy out. Nice wave dude!</td>', 'Looks windy out. Nice wave dude!', '2007-12-28 01:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340314, 624604, 43088, '<td valign="top">Everyday items colorful and nicely presented. A great shot! 7</td>', 'Everyday items colorful and nicely presented. A great shot! 7', '2007-12-28 01:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340339, 625695, 60573, '<td valign="top">Great light and exposure. I like it.</td>', 'Great light and exposure. I like it.', '2007-12-28 02:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340340, 625254, 60573, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus and a little over exposed at the bottom  Perhaps a light diffuser may give you a better light??</td>', 'Slightly out of focus and a little over exposed at the bottom  Perhaps a light diffuser may give you a better light??', '2007-12-28 02:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
