(4345154, 625534, 20330, '<td valign="top">the only thing missing is the frog =]  nice shot, great lighting and coloring, the texture is lovely.</td>', 'the only thing missing is the frog =]  nice shot, great lighting and coloring, the texture is lovely.', '2007-12-30 14:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
