(4345368, 625796, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely frost study - black and white suits it perfectly. The contrast between frosty rims and dark leaves works well.</td>', 'Lovely frost study - black and white suits it perfectly. The contrast between frosty rims and dark leaves works well.', '2007-12-30 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345370, 625641, 51597, '<td valign="top">Well done.. I simply like this alot =10</td>', 'Well done.. I simply like this alot =10', '2007-12-30 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345372, 625247, 51597, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!  Well done = 10</td>', 'Fantastic!!  Well done = 10', '2007-12-30 16:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345374, 625720, 51597, '<td valign="top">Well done!!</td>', 'Well done!!', '2007-12-30 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345375, 625018, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely grain and lovely, very subtle toning too. Sharpening seems a bit strong - there''s a wicked bright line along the top edge of the chairback. Great choice of subject - so much interesting detail, such a forlorn scene.</td>', 'Lovely grain and lovely, very subtle toning too. Sharpening seems a bit strong - there''s a wicked bright line along the top edge of the chairback. Great choice of subject - so much interesting detail, such a forlorn scene.', '2007-12-30 16:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345377, 624137, 74979, '<td valign="top">aww what a cutie face!! nice image too :)</td>', 'aww what a cutie face!! nice image too :)', '2007-12-30 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345379, 625836, 3087, '<td valign="top">The high contrast black and white approach really emphasises the texture and details of the form of a feather. I like your composition too with the diagonal line of the central shaft sweeping across the corner.</td>', 'The high contrast black and white approach really emphasises the texture and details of the form of a feather. I like your composition too with the diagonal line of the central shaft sweeping across the corner.', '2007-12-30 16:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345381, 624167, 74979, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!</td>', 'gorgeous!', '2007-12-30 16:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345382, 625683, 51597, '<td valign="top">Would like this better if the eye''s weren''t goopy...</td>', 'Would like this better if the eye''s weren''t goopy...', '2007-12-30 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345383, 625198, 51597, '<td valign="top">BRRRRRRRRRRR!!</td>', 'BRRRRRRRRRRR!!', '2007-12-30 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345385, 625014, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF and amazing composition. Almost abstract and yet still so organic. Lovely contrast between the smooth, shiny, maroon spikes and the mottled, green leaf.</td>', 'Beautiful DOF and amazing composition. Almost abstract and yet still so organic. Lovely contrast between the smooth, shiny, maroon spikes and the mottled, green leaf.', '2007-12-30 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345387, 624750, 51597, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!! Just gorgeous.. Fantastic sky..</td>', 'Fabulous!! Just gorgeous.. Fantastic sky..', '2007-12-30 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345389, 625362, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject - a lot of lovely and varying textures really shown off well by your lighting. I love the composition - that''s inspired, as well as the  bokeh of the reflected light points emphasises the shinier textures of the less worn bits of the sax. All good!</td>', 'Great choice of subject - a lot of lovely and varying textures really shown off well by your lighting. I love the composition - that''s inspired, as well as the  bokeh of the reflected light points emphasises the shinier textures of the less worn bits of the sax. All good!', '2007-12-30 16:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345392, 625817, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful (is this by Dax?), I really love the combination of sharp detail together with lots of smooth, out-of-focus areas and a nice graininess too. And lighting is lovely, so subtle, so perfect.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful (is this by Dax?), I really love the combination of sharp detail together with lots of smooth, out-of-focus areas and a nice graininess too. And lighting is lovely, so subtle, so perfect.', '2007-12-30 16:44:33.000000', NULL, 1);
