(4349965, 625811, 87318, '<td valign="top">Since this is obviously a set up shot, I would have removed the strand crossing the open skin on the left garlic head (about center of the photo, from the right side towards the left).  To me it is distracting.  Otherwise a pretty nice macro food shot IMHO.</td>', 'Since this is obviously a set up shot, I would have removed the strand crossing the open skin on the left garlic head (about center of the photo, from the right side towards the left).  To me it is distracting.  Otherwise a pretty nice macro food shot IMHO.', '2008-01-01 12:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349972, 625247, 87318, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  It took me a while to figure out where I was at and what I was seeing.  Creative.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  It took me a while to figure out where I was at and what I was seeing.  Creative.', '2008-01-01 12:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
