(4350112, 624296, 23433, '<td valign="top">It looks as if you placed the chilli on an old frying  pan. Great texture idea.</td>', 'It looks as if you placed the chilli on an old frying  pan. Great texture idea.', '2008-01-01 13:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
