(4351928, 625720, 64844, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''ve always wanted to know how roosters'' head adornements feel; your photo really has the answer! Guess, I''d rather stroke the feathers ;)))<br/>Great shot!</td>', 'Wow - I''ve always wanted to know how roosters'' head adornements feel; your photo really has the answer! Guess, I''d rather stroke the feathers ;)))Great shot!', '2008-01-01 22:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
