(4352132, 625617, 67697, '<td valign="top">That is one monster sized cookie!  I love that the cookie is on a table with a pattern or texture of some sort.  The clarity on the girl is awesome.</td>', 'That is one monster sized cookie!  I love that the cookie is on a table with a pattern or texture of some sort.  The clarity on the girl is awesome.', '2008-01-02 00:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352134, 624137, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great work Kashi.  A beautiful kitty portrait.</td>', 'Great work Kashi.  A beautiful kitty portrait.', '2008-01-02 00:17:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352135, 625544, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first honorable mention. I can almost smell the pigskin!</td>', 'Congrats on your first honorable mention. I can almost smell the pigskin!', '2008-01-02 00:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352138, 624922, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cool - at first I thought it was a closeup of a carpet.  Great job at catching the soon-to-be flyaway strands.</td>', 'Cool - at first I thought it was a closeup of a carpet.  Great job at catching the soon-to-be flyaway strands.', '2008-01-02 00:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352143, 625839, 67697, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this scored below 5.  I can see plenty of texture.  Maybe some of the voters need to touch the thorns lol.</td>', 'Not sure why this scored below 5.  I can see plenty of texture.  Maybe some of the voters need to touch the thorns lol.', '2008-01-02 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352144, 624850, 70514, '<td valign="top">You really know how to capture amazing detail and beautiful light.  Great job mixing the two.</td>', 'You really know how to capture amazing detail and beautiful light.  Great job mixing the two.', '2008-01-02 00:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352155, 624547, 67697, '<td valign="top">That spooky looking eye really jumps out at ya.  I can see the detail in the feathers below the head but since my attention is drawn to the eye, I''d like to have seen a little more focus on the head.  I do love the diagonal you created with the beak.</td>', 'That spooky looking eye really jumps out at ya.  I can see the detail in the feathers below the head but since my attention is drawn to the eye, I''d like to have seen a little more focus on the head.  I do love the diagonal you created with the beak.', '2008-01-02 00:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352224, 625817, 53316, '<td valign="top">Such GORGEOUS colors!!!!</td>', 'Such GORGEOUS colors!!!!', '2008-01-02 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352249, 625534, 52549, '<td valign="top">WTG, Roberto! This is a gorgeous image with wonderful detail. Huge congrats on winning the blue.</td>', 'WTG, Roberto! This is a gorgeous image with wonderful detail. Huge congrats on winning the blue.', '2008-01-02 00:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352251, 625678, 1024, '<td valign="top">I so want to hear the story here, sounds like so much fun!  OK, now I want a lens just like this.  The sharpness and clarity are fantastic!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-02 11:10:12.</i></td>', 'I so want to hear the story here, sounds like so much fun!  OK, now I want a lens just like this.  The sharpness and clarity are fantastic!', '2008-01-02 00:51:30.000000', '2008-01-02 11:10:12.000000', 0),
(4352254, 625505, 52549, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, John. I LOVE the colours and composition. Congrats on the yellow ribbon.</td>', 'Stunning image, John. I LOVE the colours and composition. Congrats on the yellow ribbon.', '2008-01-02 00:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352265, 625665, 52549, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad your prediction was off, lucky you''re not a fortune teller ;-) Congrats on 4th place with this truly beautiful and delicate image, Enzo.</td>', 'I''m so glad your prediction was off, lucky you''re not a fortune teller ;-) Congrats on 4th place with this truly beautiful and delicate image, Enzo.', '2008-01-02 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352272, 625817, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is such a stuning image. It reminded me of Ursula''s work when I saw it in voting. Congrats on top 10, Dana.</td>', 'This is such a stuning image. It reminded me of Ursula''s work when I saw it in voting. Congrats on top 10, Dana.', '2008-01-02 01:00:08.000000', NULL, 0),
