(4352365, 625550, 82814, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 2nd place win in this challenge.  Wonderful capture and a well deserved ribbon winner.  Cheers, Sandra.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 2nd place win in this challenge.  Wonderful capture and a well deserved ribbon winner.  Cheers, Sandra.', '2008-01-02 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352367, 625505, 59267, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!!', '2008-01-02 01:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352368, 625534, 59267, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!!', '2008-01-02 01:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352398, 624547, 30982, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good on this - how close were you??  Just slightly better focus would help to really show off the varying textures - the beak and the feathers.</td>', 'Composition is very good on this - how close were you??  Just slightly better focus would help to really show off the varying textures - the beak and the feathers.', '2008-01-02 02:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352401, 625251, 80459, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the DQ. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Bummer about the DQ. Nice shot though.', '2008-01-02 02:14:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352403, 625658, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow depth of field - works well for this, I think.  And I love the dampness of it, too.  A better shot than the score indicates, in my book.</td>', 'I like the shallow depth of field - works well for this, I think.  And I love the dampness of it, too.  A better shot than the score indicates, in my book.', '2008-01-02 02:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352406, 625643, 30982, '<td valign="top">That fade-the-B&amp;W-layer bit is one of my favorite things to do, too.  Works quite well here.  Lovely portrait!  Now reshoot for the next challenge... :-)</td>', 'That fade-the-B&W-layer bit is one of my favorite things to do, too.  Works quite well here.  Lovely portrait!  Now reshoot for the next challenge... :-)', '2008-01-02 02:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352409, 624179, 80459, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the DQ, don''t be discouraged.</td>', 'Bummer about the DQ, don''t be discouraged.', '2008-01-02 02:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352410, 625617, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent, Don.  Really excellent.</td>', 'Excellent, Don.  Really excellent.', '2008-01-02 02:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352415, 625683, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the comment about de-gooping the cat.  And yes, it certainly does provide an indication of age.  The texture on the fur is excellent - and I know from experience that isn''t an easy thing to capture.  There''s something about the way light interacts with cat fur that always makes it a challenge.</td>', 'LOL!  Love the comment about de-gooping the cat.  And yes, it certainly does provide an indication of age.  The texture on the fur is excellent - and I know from experience that isn''t an easy thing to capture.  There''s something about the way light interacts with cat fur that always makes it a challenge.', '2008-01-02 02:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352416, 625550, 36619, '<td valign="top">congrats! beautiful entry!</td>', 'congrats! beautiful entry!', '2008-01-02 02:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352459, 625534, 69368, '<td valign="top">congrats on teh well deserved ribbon! Fantastic colors and details!</td>', 'congrats on teh well deserved ribbon! Fantastic colors and details!', '2008-01-02 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352461, 625534, 69368, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bubeltrubel:</b></div><hr/><i> congrats on the well deserved ribbon! Fantastic colors and details! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by bubeltrubel: congrats on the well deserved ribbon! Fantastic colors and details! ', '2008-01-02 02:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352469, 625550, 69368, '<td valign="top">Aaah, Irene! What a beautiful image! <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Aaah, Irene! What a beautiful image! Congrats on the ribbon!', '2008-01-02 02:36:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352478, 625505, 69368, '<td valign="top">It''s really amazing!<br/>Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'It''s really amazing!Congrats on the ribbon!', '2008-01-02 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352506, 624922, 30982, '<td valign="top">They have very interesting coats - not something I''d seen up close before!  Seems coarser, sorta, than my Siamese''s fur, and not as slick as my alley cat''s fur.</td>', 'They have very interesting coats - not something I''d seen up close before!  Seems coarser, sorta, than my Siamese''s fur, and not as slick as my alley cat''s fur.', '2008-01-02 02:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352513, 625537, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this.  A lovely range of textures and the muted earthtones are wonderful!  Excellent choice for the challenge.</td>', 'I quite like this.  A lovely range of textures and the muted earthtones are wonderful!  Excellent choice for the challenge.', '2008-01-02 02:46:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352520, 624850, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sparklies did come out quite nicely!  My only nit would be I''d like to see a more colorful (or possibly less brown) background to this.</td>', 'The sparklies did come out quite nicely!  My only nit would be I''d like to see a more colorful (or possibly less brown) background to this.', '2008-01-02 02:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352525, 625625, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really quite a lovely study of detail.  In my opinion, this met the challenge very well.  Lovely light, great texture.</td>', 'Really quite a lovely study of detail.  In my opinion, this met the challenge very well.  Lovely light, great texture.', '2008-01-02 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352529, 625188, 30982, '<td valign="top">The detail in this is excellent - and Michelle is right - looks like little hands at the end of skinny arms.</td>', 'The detail in this is excellent - and Michelle is right - looks like little hands at the end of skinny arms.', '2008-01-02 02:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352535, 624137, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice finish, Lea!  I''m especially fond of the low light - the subdued nature of this really gives a great view of the texture of the fur.  An excellent cat portrait all around.</td>', 'Very nice finish, Lea!  I''m especially fond of the low light - the subdued nature of this really gives a great view of the texture of the fur.  An excellent cat portrait all around.', '2008-01-02 02:55:46.000000', NULL, 0),
