(4352543, 625093, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the color combination - can''t say I''ve ever seen a cactus that color before!  The accent of the green and the white sets it off nicely, too.</td>', 'I quite like the color combination - can''t say I''ve ever seen a cactus that color before!  The accent of the green and the white sets it off nicely, too.', '2008-01-02 02:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
