(4352763, 624850, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I have to say that your comments on this photo made me laugh out loud!<br/> <br/>I love the spectral flare at the bottom of the star....very cool.  I would agree with Deb though and say the brown of the door (?) in the background does detract a tad from the wonderful sharpness of the main image</td>', 'Well I have to say that your comments on this photo made me laugh out loud! I love the spectral flare at the bottom of the star....very cool.  I would agree with Deb though and say the brown of the door (?) in the background does detract a tad from the wonderful sharpness of the main image', '2008-01-02 04:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352768, 625678, 68035, '<td valign="top">Aw shucks Charlene it was my pleasure.  I love the fact that you got two contrasting textures in this shot and the composition is great especially with the ''main'' leaf running straight up a rule of thirds line.  Equally I think the colours and sharpness are spot on<br/> <br/>Fantastic photo and deserved to score higher</td>', 'Aw shucks Charlene it was my pleasure.  I love the fact that you got two contrasting textures in this shot and the composition is great especially with the ''main'' leaf running straight up a rule of thirds line.  Equally I think the colours and sharpness are spot on Fantastic photo and deserved to score higher', '2008-01-02 04:48:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352770, 625537, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super shot and so close to another 6 average.  I cant pretend to understand what the title means but I do love the fact that you have captured a range of textures from the gritty floor to the incredible smoothness of the pot in the far corner and that this is combined with a really subtle range of red/brown tones<br/> <br/></td>', 'Super shot and so close to another 6 average.  I cant pretend to understand what the title means but I do love the fact that you have captured a range of textures from the gritty floor to the incredible smoothness of the pot in the far corner and that this is combined with a really subtle range of red/brown tones ', '2008-01-02 04:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352774, 625800, 68035, '<td valign="top">Deb, great shot.  I love the composition which means you not only get a range of textures on the sandbag but also that the shot has a real 3d feel to it that gives it tones of pop<br/> <br/>Duper duotone conversion as well which is strong enough to give the image feeling but not overpowering to the extent that you lose the ''feel'' of what is being photographed</td>', 'Deb, great shot.  I love the composition which means you not only get a range of textures on the sandbag but also that the shot has a real 3d feel to it that gives it tones of pop Duper duotone conversion as well which is strong enough to give the image feeling but not overpowering to the extent that you lose the ''feel'' of what is being photographed', '2008-01-02 04:55:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352778, 624930, 18552, '<td valign="top">I really like your picture, am surprised it didn''t end up with a much higher score. Very nice work for a first entry! Hope you enjoy DPC as much as I do.</td>', 'I really like your picture, am surprised it didn''t end up with a much higher score. Very nice work for a first entry! Hope you enjoy DPC as much as I do.', '2008-01-02 05:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
