(4357141, 625665, 68599, '<td valign="top">Wow you must be frustrated with all these honourable mentions. Don''t worry a ribbon is just a few challenges away.</td>', 'Wow you must be frustrated with all these honourable mentions. Don''t worry a ribbon is just a few challenges away.', '2008-01-03 11:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4357152, 625161, 85886, '<td valign="top">It is a lovely shot.  Was this handheld or tripod?  You could squeeze out some more DoF by opening up more...maybe try f11 and go up from there.  The texture and colours are gorgeous but as you say, the shallow DoF doesn''t show enough of it...or rather the lovely perspective would really come out.</td>', 'It is a lovely shot.  Was this handheld or tripod?  You could squeeze out some more DoF by opening up more...maybe try f11 and go up from there.  The texture and colours are gorgeous but as you say, the shallow DoF doesn''t show enough of it...or rather the lovely perspective would really come out.', '2008-01-03 11:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4357261, 625161, 83313, '<td valign="top">Handheld. I had it in program mode and was really not paying attention to the finer details of my settings. If I had realized that was going to be my challenge entry, I might have opted for a tripod. 20/20 hindsight. Something to be aware of for future shots like that.</td>', 'Handheld. I had it in program mode and was really not paying attention to the finer details of my settings. If I had realized that was going to be my challenge entry, I might have opted for a tripod. 20/20 hindsight. Something to be aware of for future shots like that.', '2008-01-03 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4357546, 625505, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the shadow also. Would make a great cover for a holiday mag ;-)</td>', 'great shot, love the shadow also. Would make a great cover for a holiday mag ;-)', '2008-01-03 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4357556, 625665, 64568, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Enzo and I like the blue cast, unlucky on the 4th....again ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot Enzo and I like the blue cast, unlucky on the 4th....again ;-)', '2008-01-03 13:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
