(4361515, 625535, 67145, '<td valign="top">to quote .. <i>"NOT a fan of basic at all. To me it''s like telling an artist to paint something beautiful but taking away half his colors and most of his brushes. Perhaps in the film days it made sense since not everyone had access to a darkroom but not today, not now. "</i> <br/>well .. i totally agree with you there ... !!!!!!!<br/> <br/>this is brilliant even with the basic edit .. another amazing qart with your luscious model .. the camera just loves your family .. you lucky buggar !! .. <br/>i''m really starting to believe that we should have a personality test to become a voter .. obviously many of them have very serious disorders .. <br/>its like allowing a blind man to drive a bus ... the results could never be ideal .. !!!!!..:)<br/></td>', 'to quote .. "NOT a fan of basic at all. To me it''s like telling an artist to paint something beautiful but taking away half his colors and most of his brushes. Perhaps in the film days it made sense since not everyone had access to a darkroom but not today, not now. " well .. i totally agree with you there ... !!!!!!! this is brilliant even with the basic edit .. another amazing qart with your luscious model .. the camera just loves your family .. you lucky buggar !! .. i''m really starting to believe that we should have a personality test to become a voter .. obviously many of them have very serious disorders .. its like allowing a blind man to drive a bus ... the results could never be ideal .. !!!!!..:)', '2008-01-04 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
