(4368762, 625165, 84320, '<td valign="top">She''s actually Indian.<br/>Just an old lady selling some vegetables on a market.<br/>Couldn''t speak a word of english (thus couldn''t say "no photo" ;-) ).<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments.<br/>This is my second submitted picture so I''m not sure if the mark I got is a good one. <br/>Still much better than my last submission.<br/>=)<br/></td>', 'She''s actually Indian.Just an old lady selling some vegetables on a market.Couldn''t speak a word of english (thus couldn''t say "no photo" ;-) ). Thanks for your comments.This is my second submitted picture so I''m not sure if the mark I got is a good one. Still much better than my last submission.=)', '2008-01-07 05:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370645, 625544, 60805, '<td valign="top">I faved this shot, so sorry for te DQ. I normally copy from the memcard and paste to a folder and not even look at it. Then copy that folder and paste to another folder and edit from that folder. I want it to be said that i did''nt even breathe on the original LOL.<br/>Don''t worry, there''ll be more ;)</td>', 'I faved this shot, so sorry for te DQ. I normally copy from the memcard and paste to a folder and not even look at it. Then copy that folder and paste to another folder and edit from that folder. I want it to be said that i did''nt even breathe on the original LOL.Don''t worry, there''ll be more ;)', '2008-01-07 15:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372560, 625550, 41648, '<td valign="top">As always, a superb macro.  Congratulations!</td>', 'As always, a superb macro.  Congratulations!', '2008-01-08 00:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4383344, 625337, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  I love how you can see the ripple of water flowing over the leaf.  It''s cool how the texture of the leaf kind of matches the background, but the color helps it stand apart.  This is a very pretty find!</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  I love how you can see the ripple of water flowing over the leaf.  It''s cool how the texture of the leaf kind of matches the background, but the color helps it stand apart.  This is a very pretty find!', '2008-01-10 22:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4386219, 625229, 30982, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 - really liked the color combination and the overall composition.  I think it met the challenge well!</td>', 'I gave this a 7 - really liked the color combination and the overall composition.  I think it met the challenge well!', '2008-01-12 01:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4397694, 625544, 89005, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptionally nice photo.</td>', 'This is an exceptionally nice photo.', '2008-01-16 17:01:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4410250, 625641, 30048, '<td valign="top">very nice shot.real colour.thank u.</td>', 'very nice shot.real colour.thank u.', '2008-01-21 12:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4421132, 624211, 49804, '<td valign="top">Incredible texture, very interesting lighting going on, pretty nice composition, kinda leaves me dizzy looking at it with all that texture, making it very interesting, nicely done.</td>', 'Incredible texture, very interesting lighting going on, pretty nice composition, kinda leaves me dizzy looking at it with all that texture, making it very interesting, nicely done.', '2008-01-24 11:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4435253, 625537, 14986, '<td valign="top">This shot drew my eye to it as a thumbnail.  I love the natural colors and the nice lighting.  I think perhaps a bit tighter crop and setting the subjects off center a bit might have given it even more appeal.   I think it was a good choice for the challenge and as is, I would have given it a 6.  With just a little tweaking, easily a 7.</td>', 'This shot drew my eye to it as a thumbnail.  I love the natural colors and the nice lighting.  I think perhaps a bit tighter crop and setting the subjects off center a bit might have given it even more appeal.   I think it was a good choice for the challenge and as is, I would have given it a 6.  With just a little tweaking, easily a 7.', '2008-01-28 23:21:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4523662, 625267, 50695, '<td valign="top">too bad people didn''t understand the challenge. This conveys "texture" very nicely.</td>', 'too bad people didn''t understand the challenge. This conveys "texture" very nicely.', '2008-02-27 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4622808, 625658, 56880, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot happening in this shot.  Given your conditions, I might have tried to pick out something that''d line up in the narrow DOF, like the brown grassy thing behind the right flower looking thing (I''m bad at botany).  The large blurred flower looking thing on the left demands attention with its color, but ends up being just a distraction.</td>', 'There''s a lot happening in this shot.  Given your conditions, I might have tried to pick out something that''d line up in the narrow DOF, like the brown grassy thing behind the right flower looking thing (I''m bad at botany).  The large blurred flower looking thing on the left demands attention with its color, but ends up being just a distraction.', '2008-04-08 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4628091, 624604, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job for your first entry.  I am proud of how you got this effect from your window. I am in your position and find myself using windows a great deal.  A tiny bit more light on the left would have helped - try maybe positioning (having someone hold) a mirror to reflect some light? but it''s not a major thing.   Besides the lighting, the composition is really nice - lots of elements without seeming busy, and the lines flow nicely.  When I first saw this shot I thought that it would work really nicely as an element in a website that sells bath products.  It''s just really put together well and captures what "bath time" is (at least for women :-) ) all about.</td>', 'Wow, great job for your first entry.  I am proud of how you got this effect from your window. I am in your position and find myself using windows a great deal.  A tiny bit more light on the left would have helped - try maybe positioning (having someone hold) a mirror to reflect some light? but it''s not a major thing.   Besides the lighting, the composition is really nice - lots of elements without seeming busy, and the lines flow nicely.  When I first saw this shot I thought that it would work really nicely as an element in a website that sells bath products.  It''s just really put together well and captures what "bath time" is (at least for women :-) ) all about.', '2008-04-09 18:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4659620, 625264, 88523, '<td valign="top">Always cool when someone makes the mundane...interesting.<br/></td>', 'Always cool when someone makes the mundane...interesting.', '2008-04-25 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4676448, 625711, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really love the strong orange colors, and awesome textures, in this nature shot.....</td>', 'I really love the strong orange colors, and awesome textures, in this nature shot.....', '2008-05-03 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 0),
