(4800340, 624725, 12611, '<td valign="top">This shot is great- its compostionally strong, and its really nice colors, but the essence of it is that perfect time of day, everyone knows it, and it doesn''t last long; that is great patience to get a great shot.</td>', 'This shot is great- its compostionally strong, and its really nice colors, but the essence of it is that perfect time of day, everyone knows it, and it doesn''t last long; that is great patience to get a great shot.', '2008-07-03 01:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
